    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im taking ambien for sleep cuz ive been super stressed lately and it works good but ive been having a really rough week and feeling super anxious. would it be okay if i had like one glass of wine before bed tonight along with my ambien just to help me relax more so i can sleep deeper? like is that safe or something?",
