    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it sounds risky but i feel like i'm already being super careful. i'm not talking like a whole bottle, just literally one small glass of white wine to take the edge off. i've heard of people doing this and being fine. is it really that dangerous if it's just a tiny amount? like wouldn't my body be able to handle that level?",
